.text-center
  span.green font to svg
  h1 Convert Fonts to SVG Online
.sep.huge-gap
p This font to SVG converter turns your text into #[span.green SVG paths]: every letter becomes a vector shape, so the result looks the same everywhere without installing or embedding the font. Choose from 800+ open-font-licensed fonts, type your text and download the SVG.
br
h3 What can I use it for?
ul
  li Logos and headings in Figma, Illustrator, Inkscape or any vector editor
  li Cutting machines and laser engravers ( Cricut, Silhouette, Glowforge ) - set fill opacity to 0 to keep only the outline
  li Icons and titles on websites, as inline SVG ( use the SVG Code button to copy it ) or an image
  li A transparent PNG of your text, at any size
br
h3 Paths, not text
p The downloaded SVG contains outlines instead of a #[code &lt;text&gt;] element, so the words can't be edited or searched after export. Keep the original text if you need to change it later, and add an #[code alt] text when you use it as an image.
+nbr(4)
